SUMMARY:Conestoga Trail and More Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike\, featuring the Conestoga Trail with 
 great views\, Wind Cave\, Tucquan Glen\, pleasant back roads\, and back wo
 ods other trails.\nAfter meeting on the Enola Low Grade Trail lot\, we wil
 l shuttle with as few vehicles as possible to Pequea to begin our hike.\nW
 e'll have a rougher first six miles on the Conestoga Trail with reroutes p
 ast House Rock and up into Tucquan Glen. We then follow pleasant back road
 s for a while\, which are really nice for walking. This will be just under
  five miles.\nThe final miles will mostly be within Martic Township Park\,
  a large wooded tract. We'll meander though this until we reach the road n
 ear our end point and walk two tenths of a mile to the end.\nIf needed\, c
 ontact me at 908 343 8374
